  "summary_en": "China's State Council and Central Military Commission interim regulations (Order 761, effective 1 Jan 2024) governing unmanned aircraft: weight-based classification, airworthiness approval, real-name registration, operator licensing, airspace control, flight approval, liability insurance, counter-drone measures and penalties.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Classifies UAs as micro, light, small, medium and large; medium and large require airworthiness approval",
   "Mandates real-name registration, unique product ID, and operator licences for small and larger UAs",
   "Defines controlled airspace and flight application/approval rules, with exemptions for low-risk and agricultural flights",
   "Requires liability insurance for commercial flights and for small, medium and large non-commercial UAs",
   "Sets fines, suspension and criminal/civil liability, and regulates counter-drone equipment"
